; SHORT WAVE DISRUPTORS, the core system (design 1.1). Shipped EMPTY at SP1 with its name and flavour
; rows so the frame's trait order is final from the start; SP2 adds the Mask of Many Faces menu,
; Drain, Stabilizer Override and Soulbind, SP3 Entrap and Ensorcel, SP4 Neuro-Hijack.
;
; KEEP THIS KIT NON-TECH (design 2.1's trap): if it ever carries a tech action, every reaction on it is
; refused against tech-immune units (unit_action.gd:567-571, action_reaction.gd:107-110). SP5: icon.
